63,"Composition"],[1601,"Composition"],[1656,"Composition"],[1673,"Composition"],[1717,"Composition"],[1742,"Composition"],[1858,"Composition"],[1887,"Composition"],[1953,"Composition"],[1975,"Composition"],[2053,"Composition"],[2098,"Composition"],[2128,"Composition"],[2153,"Composition"],[2177,"Composition"],[1950,"Composition parts for a bordered table card using the shared data-table classes."],[2282,"Consumer monorepo scaffolding (`shadcn-nsh create`) is not built. `init` and `add` work in a workspace that already has `apps/*` and a `packages/ui` named `@workspace/ui` (or already holding `nsh-ui.json`)."],[1080,"Contacts as `ItemGroup` rows inside a `List` (`nsh`'s virtualized list), with a heading per letter that sticks to the top until the next one pushes it out. Rows are made as they scroll in, so the list can be as long as the data. `stickyHeaderIndices` names the heading rows; a heading needs an opaque background (the surface's own), or the rows show through it while it sticks."],[1497,"Content with its own frame"],[680,"Context Menu"],[103,"Controlled"],[130,"Controlled"],[443,"Controlled"],[756,"Controlled"],[1863,"Controlled"],[855,"Controlled text"],[2345,"Controls"],[2258,"Controls whose shape varies by platform (`checkbox`, `switch`, `slider`, `radio-group`, `progress`, `spinner`, `calendar`, `sheet`) read the theme's control geometry through `control(\"switch\")`, `control(\"slider\")`, `control(\"choice\")`, and `control(\"field\")`."],[57,"Copies items and their `registryDependencies` into the app, dependencies first."],[2018,"Copy on code blocks"],[2267,"Copy-into-app"],[1467,"Cross line"],[1144,"Current"],[1451,"Custom items"],[2230,"Custom themes"],[2228,"Customizing"],[2232,"Customizing copied components"],[35,"Customizing derives a theme and edits a copied component."],[702,"DataTable"],[723,"Date Picker"],[1704,"Decorative or not"],[1428,"Default `pair`: chevrons stacked at the end. `split`: − before the field and + after it."],[804,"Default